      "id": "F11",
      "claim": "The Go changes since v0.0.3 replace the companion daemon's environment configuration with extensions: go/internal/iam adds schema migration 24, an extensions table whose shared secret is sealed with the credential encryption key and covered by the key check and `llmgw credentials rekey`; go/internal/api adds the admin routes under /admin/api/extensions (list, add, change, remove, check), removes GET /admin/api/companion-daemon, names every route and connection that keeps a provider from deletion in its 409, carries an extension through sign-in, and warns at startup while LLMGW_EXTENSION_URL or LLMGW_EXTENSION_SECRET is set; go/internal/config persists a provider's extension; go/internal/providers resolves each daemon-served provider's extension instead of reading those variables, and counts response_format as sent for OpenAI Codex, Google Antigravity, Google AI Studio and Vertex AI; go/internal/router/failover.go moves the Responses chain past a target its Chat fallback refuses; go/cmd/llmgw/main.go only loads the stored extensions in `serve`; go.mod and go.sum move llmgw-core from 0.0.2 to 0.0.3. The files that decode /v1 request bodies (go/internal/api/openai.go, responses_api.go, anthropic.go) and that check administrator authentication (go/internal/api/sso.go) are not changed, and go/internal/api/server.go changes only the extension and companion daemon routes.",
