    "summary": "Every accepted assertion, A1 to A10, was exercised against a build of the exact head commit 73b6b809 and held. The changes add extensions, which replace the companion daemon's LLMGW_EXTENSION_URL and LLMGW_EXTENSION_SECRET with an admin API and a console shelf and store their secrets encrypted under schema migration 24; carry response_format to Codex, Antigravity and Google; move the Responses chain past a target its Chat fallback refuses; revise console states and the documentation; and update llmgw-core to 0.0.3. Retiring the two variables and the migration are compatibility changes the upgrade guide describes; none changes what the accepted contract asserts, so it is reused for this source."
